WEBVTT

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.620
"I'm heading to the Big Gate for a bit.

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:20.790
The rest is in your hands," huh?

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:22.910
Even if you tell me that...

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:29.120
Still, that's so typical of Dad.

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:30.540
The Big Gate, huh?

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:35.160
The heart of the world, Gatepia.

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:41.580
Long ago, it was said to be
a desolate and forsaken land, but...

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:45.000
...one day, a goddess
appeared from the heavens...

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:55.040
...and brought forth a gigantic gate.

00:00:57.410 --> 00:01:01.870
Across the lands,
other smaller gates appeared as well.

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:06.660
People swarmed through the gates
to gather what was found inside--

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:10.700
the miracle energy and foundation
of our world, "kirakuri."

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:19.290
And so, the world prospered,

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:25.790
and businesses and adventurer guilds
sprout up around the city.

00:01:28.370 --> 00:01:32.500
And one day, my childhood friend
Yutoria wanted to meet me.

00:01:35.830 --> 00:01:39.450
She said it was about something important, but...

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:47.040
What if it's a confession?!

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:49.330
N-No! That can't be it!

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:51.910
Yutoria's just my childhood friend!

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:57.160
A-Anyways, better hurry!

00:02:09.950 --> 00:02:13.620
Minato! You kept me waiting, you know!

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:18.290
S-Sorry! Pretty sure I came
right on time though...

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:21.000
Businessmen arrive five minutes early!

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:23.750
What if you're late to a vital meeting?!

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:26.750
A-Anyways, what's so important?

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:29.410
That's...

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:34.620
Actually, I... for the longest time...

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:35.910
Could this be...?!

00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:38.410
For the longest time, I've...

00:02:38.410 --> 00:02:41.250
I-I knew it!

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:43.790
I've thought you'd make a good president!

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:47.500
Please, Minato! Be the president
of Kibou Company!

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:51.200
Huh?

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:52.750
What?!

00:02:53.410 --> 00:02:55.950
<i>President, It's Time for Battle</i>!

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:05.750
"Episode One: Induction as President"

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:08.120
W-Wait up a sec!

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:12.290
Let's head to the office first!
I'll explain the rest there!

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:14.450
Fine, just let go!

00:03:14.450 --> 00:03:17.250
No, I cannot let you escape.

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:20.580
It's not like I'm some pervert
on a packed canal boat...

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:30.000
Your father left behind a letter
before his untimely departure.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:34.870
Without a president in place,
the company will certainly go bankrupt.

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:37.660
I was thinking about that too, actually.

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:40.910
Wait... Why are you talking all funny?

00:03:40.910 --> 00:03:45.000
Since I shall be your secretary,
I must be more polite!

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:47.450
I mustn't mix work and pleasure!

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:49.330
Yutoria, my secretary?

00:03:54.910 --> 00:03:58.660
Here we are, President!
Right on schedule at three o'clock!

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:03.000
Kibou Company...

00:04:07.790 --> 00:04:10.580
This brings back memories...

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:13.120
Haven't been here since I was a kid.

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:16.120
The old man's desk has been cleaned,

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:19.330
and their personal effects
are no longer here.

00:04:19.330 --> 00:04:22.330
He really did head for the Big Gate...

00:04:22.330 --> 00:04:28.120
Regardless of his objective,
our company is in danger of bankruptcy.

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:31.450
So we need you to work hard as president!

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:36.000
H-Hold on a sec!
I still haven't decided to do it yet!

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:38.200
Aren't you unemployed right now?

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:39.370
Erm...

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:42.500
And wasting day after day as a NEET?

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:48.370
W-Well, I'm just recharging my batteries!
I'll look for work someday!

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:53.580
Scramble to land any old job
and you'll get exploited by a sweatshop.

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:57.200
T-True, companies have been pretty bad lately.

00:04:57.200 --> 00:05:03.040
With excess overtime and unpaid wages,
crying out for a labor reform...

00:05:03.040 --> 00:05:04.950
That's why it's perfect!

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:08.830
We're not dirty,
but we're not spotless either...

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:12.660
It's not always black and white, okay?
We're off-white!

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:14.580
B-But...

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:20.620
In any case, please sign this document
and officially become our president!

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:27.290
Does it really have to be me though?
Why don't you just do it?

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:29.950
I'm not suited to be president.

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:32.660
I'm better at supporting people.

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:35.410
What about the other employees?

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:38.660
Including me, there're four people who work here.

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:43.870
It's hard to see any of us as president
since we like to be in the thick of it.

00:05:43.870 --> 00:05:49.040
I see... Thing is, I don't even know
what a president does.

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:54.700
I went ahead and prepared this for you!

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:55.700
Oh...

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:57.620
What is it?

00:05:57.620 --> 00:06:02.120
You don't know? It's a learning kit
from the Adventure Agency!

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:05.750
"The Dungeon Clearing Pictorial Tutorial!"

00:06:05.750 --> 00:06:09.830
That's some wild naming sense
for a government agency.

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:12.160
It's the Adventure's bible!

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:15.370
By watching this,
even if you're as dumb as a slaby,

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:17.450
you'll learn how to clear dungeons!

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:28.290
Hello! How are you doing today?

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:33.080
This program is an important lesson
about workplace basics

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:37.830
for all the presidents of
adventure companies out there!

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:41.370
Please sit <i>seiza </i>and watch at least three times!

00:06:41.370 --> 00:06:43.200
Wh-Why <i>seiza</i>?

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:47.000
Follow the instructions, President!
You're a newbie!

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:50.290
I still haven't decided to do this, you know.

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:53.370
First off, let's explain dungeon exploration!

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:57.660
Presidents accept jobs from customers
or the Adventurer Agency

00:06:57.660 --> 00:07:02.950
and lead their employees as they
adventure through gates like this!

00:07:04.620 --> 00:07:07.200
While progressing through the dungeon,

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:11.870
it's your job to direct the battle
when confronted by maju!

00:07:11.870 --> 00:07:14.910
It's a slaby... I hate how soft
and flabby they are...

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:18.700
Also, since there can be traps within dungeons,

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:22.700
it's also your duty to carefully choose a route!

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:24.950
Thing is, I get lost easily.

00:07:24.950 --> 00:07:27.910
You'll get used to it, so no worries!

00:07:27.910 --> 00:07:31.580
Inside dungeons is where you'll find kirakuri,

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:34.830
along with other minerals
and stuff you can gather

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:38.120
in exchange for money to run your business!

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:43.580
You use that money to pay your employees

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:48.790
and purchase more equipment
to support further adventures!

00:07:48.790 --> 00:07:53.250
Now, let's move on to explain
staff approvals and paperwork.

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:58.500
Th-This is more complicated than I thought.
I'm getting dizzy...

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:01.790
...and that concludes the lesson!

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:05.700
By treating your workers well
and knowing business basics,

00:08:05.700 --> 00:08:09.370
you'll be able to live a fun,
enjoyable president life!

00:08:13.790 --> 00:08:17.040
How was it, President?

00:08:17.040 --> 00:08:18.000
President?

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:22.040
Oh... Y-Yeah! That was such a great explanation!

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:25.910
President? What's the matter?

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:28.620
My legs are tingling!

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:34.500
Oh, please. You'll need to shape up
if you want to get any real work done.

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:38.580
R-Right. How about I just avoid sitting <i>seiza</i>?

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:40.290
Hmm?

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:42.370
We're back!

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:44.660
Ah, I'm exhausted!

00:08:44.660 --> 00:08:47.410
That was a bit tougher than we thought.

00:08:47.410 --> 00:08:51.500
Oh, these are the other employees
who were out on a job.

00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:53.370
Welcome back, everyone!

00:08:53.370 --> 00:08:55.250
It's good to be back!

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:58.250
Oh? That's the guy you talked about...

00:08:58.250 --> 00:08:59.870
He finally came.

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:05.000
Yes! He's the new representative
of our company, President Minato!

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:09.450
Huh? W-Wait up, Yutoria! I haven't decided yet!

00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:12.000
Allow me to introduce everyone!

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:15.870
Um... D-Do you not hear when I talk?

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:19.790
This is our priest, Makoto.

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:24.160
Though he's our youngest at 17,
he's still a four-star adventurer!

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:26.700
Leave all your healing needs to him!

00:09:26.700 --> 00:09:28.790
It's nice to meet you, President.

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:30.950
S-Same here.

00:09:30.950 --> 00:09:34.910
Hmm? By the way,
that's a big rucksack you've got...

00:09:34.910 --> 00:09:37.500
Oh, um! This is...

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:39.830
Tsk! Shut your mouth.

00:09:39.830 --> 00:09:43.000
Try calling me baggage and I'll kill you!

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:44.750
Huh? What's inside?

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:48.000
N-Nothing! It's just a normal rucksack!

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:49.660
R-Right...

00:09:49.660 --> 00:09:51.950
This is Akari, a soldier.

00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:55.080
She's strong, trusty, and Makoto's big sister!

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:57.370
You're our new president?

00:09:57.370 --> 00:09:59.750
Looks unreliable to me...

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:01.830
I-I'm sorry.

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:04.660
It's not official yet anyways.

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:08.000
Lastly, here's our veteran employee, Guide!

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:13.250
She's worked here the longest
and does office work and accounting!

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:15.250
It's a pleasure to meet you!

00:10:20.700 --> 00:10:25.040
The four of us here are
the employees of Kibou Company!

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:29.540
Under your direction as president,
we'll do our best to succeed!

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:32.160
Bring us lots of juicy jobs to do!

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:35.290
I'd prefer having weekends off though.

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:39.790
As long as there's money in it for me,
I'm up for any job!

00:10:39.790 --> 00:10:42.870
U-Um, I keep saying this, but...

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:44.500
Stare...

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:51.580
Now then, since introductions are out
of the way, let's go clear a dungeon!

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:53.080
Huh? Right now?

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:57.410
When inducting a new president,
they must first pass a test

00:10:57.410 --> 00:11:02.660
and thereby gain the approval
of 12 executive shareholders.

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:07.370
He needs to clear a dungeon
selected by the staff, correct?

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:09.290
A dungeon, huh?

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:11.660
What? Have you never done one?

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:15.080
It'll be fine! We'll support you!

00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:17.370
I'll come along as well!

00:11:17.370 --> 00:11:19.580
Anything to say, President?

00:11:19.580 --> 00:11:20.700
Huh?

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:23.370
Say something to encourage us!

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:27.580
U-Um... L-Let's go!

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:30.120
Y-Yeah...!

00:11:33.950 --> 00:11:35.950
Past that's a dungeon, huh?

00:11:35.950 --> 00:11:39.660
It shouldn't be that difficult, so don't worry!

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:42.000
I brought a map along too!

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:44.620
Oh, and take this.

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:45.700
A sword?

00:11:47.160 --> 00:11:48.870
Is that a stamp?

00:11:48.870 --> 00:11:53.540
Yes! Once we defeat a boss maju,
you just need to stamp it!

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:56.450
It gets sent to the Agency and we get a reward!

00:11:57.660 --> 00:11:58.830
Boss, huh?

00:11:59.750 --> 00:12:03.000
Just stamp and you're done!
Come on, let's move it!

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:15.410
Ugh, I'm so nervous...

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:19.000
So, President.
You have an adventurer license, right?

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:20.410
--Hmm?
--What rank?

00:12:20.410 --> 00:12:23.870
Um, two stars, I think?

00:12:23.870 --> 00:12:26.540
Two stars?! And you're our president?!

00:12:26.540 --> 00:12:29.410
Seven's the most, so he's near the bottom.

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:31.330
Like I said, unreliable...

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:33.410
I-I dunno what to tell you.

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:39.120
That's enough chit-chat! There's maju!

00:12:40.080 --> 00:12:41.660
President! Your orders?!

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:43.790
Uh, right...!

00:12:43.790 --> 00:12:48.540
Being a mucus-type maju,
slaby can't be that strong...

00:12:48.540 --> 00:12:50.330
Huh?

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:52.160
Th-That was easy!

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:54.000
A piece of cake for me.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:56.370
That wasn't even a challenge.

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:59.160
But I guess it works as a warm-up!

00:12:59.160 --> 00:13:00.910
Oh, really?

00:13:00.910 --> 00:13:05.000
Yutoria, will we be okay
with him as our president?

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:06.790
Yes! Absolutely!

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:10.700
But, maybe...

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:13.660
Make up your mind! Which is it?!

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:16.120
We should be nearing the end.

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:19.540
If we can find kirakuri, you pass the test.

00:13:19.540 --> 00:13:20.410
Huh?

00:13:20.410 --> 00:13:22.830
A-A kid? In a place like this?

00:13:22.830 --> 00:13:26.120
Maybe they got mixed up with some adventurers?

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:28.910
Hey, you. What's wrong? You okay?

00:13:30.250 --> 00:13:34.540
Are you guys part of an adventurer
company or something?

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:36.910
Yeah. You could say that.

00:13:36.910 --> 00:13:39.040
My name is Thomas!

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:42.450
Hey, do you think you could
accept a job from me?

00:13:42.450 --> 00:13:44.410
A job? From you?

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:47.540
Of course, I'm willing to pay.

00:13:49.290 --> 00:13:52.450
Oh, my. What a little customer we found.

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:54.660
By the way, what's the job?

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:57.330
Hey now! We're in the middle of your test!

00:13:57.330 --> 00:13:59.290
I understand that, but...

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:02.410
The kirakuri we're after might be nearby!

00:14:02.410 --> 00:14:05.620
Still, no matter how small a job it is,

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:09.160
if someone thinks it's important,
I wanna help 'em out.

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:14.790
Speaking of which, the old man
used to say that too.

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:18.790
Yeah, sure did. He took jobs
without caring for profits.

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:22.500
Everyone who came along was welcomed.

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:26.120
Let's not forget he picked me up too.

00:14:27.250 --> 00:14:29.200
So? What's the plan?

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:31.950
Of course, we accept! You're our customer!

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:35.790
Yippee! Thanks, mister!

00:14:35.790 --> 00:14:39.200
Mind telling us what your request is?

00:14:39.200 --> 00:14:42.120
I want to get a sialme flower!

00:14:42.120 --> 00:14:45.250
Is that the one that grows high on cliffs?

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:50.700
Yeah. And I spotted one growing
right there, but I can't reach it.

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:54.080
Th-That's pretty high up there.

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:55.910
Why do you want it though?

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:58.660
It's my sister's birthday tomorrow.

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:02.660
Since she's always taking care of me,
I want to thank her!

00:15:02.660 --> 00:15:05.580
I see. That's very kind.

00:15:05.580 --> 00:15:07.750
All right. We'll take care of it, so--

00:15:07.750 --> 00:15:09.410
Leave it to me!

00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:13.950
Huh? Akari didn't seem thrilled
about this before...

00:15:13.950 --> 00:15:15.790
I'll go too!

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:18.080
Okay. You guys just wait here.

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:20.160
All right. Be careful!

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:21.580
Right!

00:15:21.580 --> 00:15:23.120
Wait for me!

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:25.660
Jeez, you're so pathetic!

00:15:25.660 --> 00:15:28.950
If you don't get in shape,
I fear for your future!

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:31.500
G-Good point.

00:15:31.500 --> 00:15:34.750
But still, why does it have to be sialme?

00:15:34.750 --> 00:15:38.580
There're lots of flowers much easier to get.

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:41.250
It's thanks for care and love.

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:41.950
Huh?

00:15:41.950 --> 00:15:46.540
That's what it represents.
It's probably why he picked it.

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:47.580
I see.

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:53.370
To tell you the truth, Makoto once
gave me sialme as a present too.

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:55.750
I doubt he remembers though.

00:15:55.750 --> 00:15:57.500
Oh. So that's why you--

00:15:57.500 --> 00:16:00.870
Yup. It reminded me of back then.

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:09.120
Just a little further...!

00:16:09.120 --> 00:16:11.080
Come on!

00:16:11.080 --> 00:16:12.370
A little more...!

00:16:13.540 --> 00:16:15.160
Got it!

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:17.290
Wait... Huh?!

00:16:17.290 --> 00:16:18.290
Wha...?!

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:23.830
That hurt!

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:25.830
Are you okay?!

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:27.790
I'm all right, but...

00:16:30.450 --> 00:16:33.160
That didn't even... faze me!

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:37.700
Um, you look in rough shape to me...

00:16:37.700 --> 00:16:40.660
H-Here's the flower you wanted.

00:16:40.660 --> 00:16:44.080
Thanks so much, mister! Ma'am!

00:16:46.200 --> 00:16:47.200
It's a maju!

00:16:48.950 --> 00:16:50.870
Thomas, run away!

00:16:50.870 --> 00:16:51.910
O-Okay!

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:57.040
President, please be careful!
It's a boss maju, volf!

00:16:57.040 --> 00:16:59.120
Wh-What do you want me to do?

00:17:02.160 --> 00:17:04.370
It's tough, but part of the test!

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:07.290
Defeat it and we'll get a reward!

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:09.500
B-But what do I do?

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:12.040
Stand back and leave it to me!

00:17:12.040 --> 00:17:13.700
A-All right.

00:17:17.330 --> 00:17:18.580
It's quick!

00:17:18.580 --> 00:17:22.120
I didn't expect an enemy
of this caliber to appear.

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:24.580
President! Your orders for battle?!

00:17:24.580 --> 00:17:30.040
G-Good luck! Let's fight as one
and use teamwork to win!

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:32.450
That was the plan from the start!

00:17:34.250 --> 00:17:35.450
You're wide open!

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:45.040
What?! You got eyes on the back of your head?!

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:52.830
Ah, that's not good.
Nearby slaby came to attack Akari.

00:17:52.830 --> 00:17:55.250
I-I'll go help! You little...!

00:17:56.410 --> 00:17:57.410
Huh?

00:17:58.830 --> 00:18:02.200
Stay back, President! Don't take part in battle!

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:07.870
Good grief! What are you doing?!

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:15.200
Shoot!

00:18:15.200 --> 00:18:17.330
Fall back, Sis! I'll heal!

00:18:18.330 --> 00:18:21.040
Its reflexes might be problematic.

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:25.120
It's my fault she's hurt.

00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:27.370
But why can't our attacks land?

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:30.580
It shouldn't be able to see behind it.

00:18:32.700 --> 00:18:35.700
It's got a scary face,
and yet that fluffy tail...

00:18:36.950 --> 00:18:38.250
Could that be it?!

00:18:39.290 --> 00:18:41.410
Eww! This is so gross!

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:46.290
President! You fight like a child!

00:18:46.290 --> 00:18:49.080
Shut up! You guys throw some too!

00:18:49.080 --> 00:18:53.040
I think all that fluff acts
like an attack sensor!

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:57.620
I see! It might be able to sense
changes in wind pressure!

00:18:57.620 --> 00:19:00.500
Just like the horn of an insect!

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:03.950
I think you meant antenna,
but anyways, just throw!

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:05.000
All right!

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:14.040
Makoto, how's Akari?

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:15.660
In perfect shape!

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:17.370
Akari, go for it!

00:19:17.370 --> 00:19:19.120
Okay!

00:19:19.120 --> 00:19:22.830
Just... leave... it... to... me!

00:19:26.830 --> 00:19:29.370
President! Quick, stamp it!

00:19:29.370 --> 00:19:30.410
Right!

00:19:36.450 --> 00:19:38.370
Huh? It's gone...

00:19:38.370 --> 00:19:41.540
The Adventure Agency will send all rewards

00:19:41.540 --> 00:19:44.700
on the 25th day of the following month.

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:46.540
I-I see...

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:49.830
It still hasn't sunk in that we beat a maju.

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:52.120
It's all just one part of the job.

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:53.830
Y-Yeah.

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:55.950
Akari, are you hurt?

00:19:55.950 --> 00:19:58.450
I already said it's no big deal!

00:19:58.450 --> 00:20:01.500
I'll get workers' comp for it anyways.

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:05.580
Well, we properly dispatched the boss, so now...

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:08.120
Mister!

00:20:09.910 --> 00:20:17.330
I saw something over there!
Maybe it's what you're looking for?

00:20:17.330 --> 00:20:18.700
There it is!

00:20:20.750 --> 00:20:24.120
Kirakuri with a note that you passed the test!

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:27.620
Now your induction as president is recognized!

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:33.660
Wh-While I'm honored, I still need
some time to think about whether--

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:39.700
A toast! To our new president
and clearing a dungeon!

00:20:39.700 --> 00:20:41.200
Cheers!

00:20:42.200 --> 00:20:44.700
In the end, nobody cared what I said.

00:20:46.450 --> 00:20:48.790
Congratulations, President!

00:20:48.790 --> 00:20:50.790
You guided us admirably.

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:56.160
Well, good work.
Running into battle was a dumb idea though.

00:20:56.160 --> 00:21:01.700
Akari isn't being very honest.
She said your guidance was perfect.

00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:04.330
Sh-Shut up!

00:21:04.330 --> 00:21:07.620
Anyways, it ending well is all that matters!

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:10.120
Though, I am worried for the future...

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:12.290
Maybe don't say that aloud.

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:19.910
Tsk! Get a grip, boy. Wet behind the ears much?

00:21:19.910 --> 00:21:21.450
Huh? You say something?

00:21:21.450 --> 00:21:26.080
N-No! You're imagining things!
That was the alcohol talking!

00:21:26.080 --> 00:21:28.120
I'm not even drunk though.

00:21:29.540 --> 00:21:34.450
Anyways, I need do some reports
and accounting, so enjoy yourselves.

00:21:34.450 --> 00:21:36.000
Good work today!

00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:38.200
Um...!

00:21:38.200 --> 00:21:42.250
Weren't you in
"The Dungeon Clearing Pictorial Tutorial"?

00:21:42.250 --> 00:21:44.750
Ah, I take it you watched that?

00:21:44.750 --> 00:21:48.200
Wasn't that made by the Adventure Agency?

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:49.870
Why are you in the film?

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:53.290
That's a secret.

00:21:57.040 --> 00:22:00.870
Th-These guys sure are a mysterious bunch.

00:22:00.870 --> 00:22:03.370
Will I be able to make it work out?

00:22:06.950 --> 00:22:08.790
Me as president, huh?

00:22:08.790 --> 00:22:11.790
Yes! Our company rep and president.

00:22:13.660 --> 00:22:15.950
I knew you'd be here.

00:22:15.950 --> 00:22:19.250
You always came here when you were little.

00:22:19.250 --> 00:22:20.250
Yeah.

00:22:22.410 --> 00:22:24.790
It's love that I feel.

00:22:24.790 --> 00:22:25.790
Huh?!

00:22:26.830 --> 00:22:29.750
For the employees. All of them.

00:22:29.750 --> 00:22:32.790
That's why I don't want to lose this place.

00:22:32.790 --> 00:22:36.290
I see. I get it.

00:22:36.290 --> 00:22:41.040
So, thank you for taking the job
and becoming our president.

00:22:41.040 --> 00:22:44.410
Hey, Yutoria?

00:22:44.410 --> 00:22:46.250
I'll do my best.

00:22:46.250 --> 00:22:50.700
I know I'm inexperienced,
but I'll try hard to be a good president.

00:22:50.700 --> 00:22:56.950
So, both as a friend and my secretary,
I'd be happy to have your help.

00:22:56.950 --> 00:22:59.500
Of course! It's my pleasure!

00:23:01.200 --> 00:23:04.080
I can't get used to you talking polite.

00:23:04.080 --> 00:23:06.540
I-I'm terribly sorry! Ah...

00:23:19.950 --> 00:23:22.910
Kibou Company has a new president?

00:23:22.910 --> 00:23:28.000
I don't know who they are, but I, Rivar,
will teach him a lesson!

00:23:29.660 --> 00:23:35.080
And just like that,
I started working as president.

00:23:35.080 --> 00:23:38.290
My days as president have just begun.

00:23:40.450 --> 00:23:44.040
And I've got a hunch it'll be a wonderful thing.

00:23:47.370 --> 00:23:49.870
Good morning, everyone!

00:23:49.870 --> 00:23:51.830
Wh-What's wrong, guys?

00:23:51.830 --> 00:23:55.500
President! I'm afraid our company...

00:23:55.500 --> 00:23:57.500
Our company...

00:23:57.500 --> 00:23:59.500
...is out of money!

00:24:00.830 --> 00:24:03.080
My days as president...

00:24:03.080 --> 00:24:08.120
It being a wonderful thing
was nothing more than a hunch.
